om/v/t64.5771-25/499624606_1095971556376466_1471595274486651159_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aaET0DDOXiMQ7kNvwHpl7Cv&_nc_oc=AdpzBZy4yBTaPpgHCu4xsW4tjqZrLJQNQMopCYgFQAHyKJu3pCmay11vc5AZWT8K2zg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyTsUaxpZGvKeSuNAGesBa3YjBCFIQyvDnK7Wg-sq-NA&oe=6AFB3858"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-2026-10-24-210200-AI-2560x1440.png", "id": "2349247579151370", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628882_2349247585818036_3208582396311749869_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hNBVihyij8sQ7kNvwEMqHWy&_nc_oc=AdqhWl50LH69I20GAsfzpTG0ByZaCtdo_BgNayEUxiPiEtRoi2MJELMBXPfz59Lx_yw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT8mn-WX6B75VGw2sNKlzuq_q-hfs1Ehyi4TaGhL9GbJw&oe=6AFB3717"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "serial-killer-simulator-cover-2560x1440.png", "id": "2386737492063367", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623115_2386737495396700_3166725170489566497_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j2VRcOXjgLgQ7kNvwFWbqNf&_nc_oc=AdpeApBX7KsvuvGpSS98B1UoSaKluKxFeP-Zkxg5mRHqXG3cngEhDcUUeWVLtAxbKBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSiDVTr8gVRrEhbt3yZa02v5T2o8hOQQ1rl9TqqyJQ7TA&oe=6AFB2EC8"}, "display_name": "Serial Killer Simulator", "keywords": ["Physics", "Sandbox", "Action", "Gore", "Slasher"], "long_description": "Step behind the mask in Serial Killer Simulator, a VR slasher horror game where you become the threat lurking beyond the campfire.\nStalk isolated camps, watch your targets, and choose your moment to strike. Move through dark forests, search cabins, and turn familiar surroundings into places of terror. Get close, grab your victims, swing your weapon, and use the environment in brutal, physics-based encounters.\nThe campers won\u2019t simply wait for you. They search for supplies,  hide, warn each other, fight back, and prepare their escape. Stop them from repairing vehicles or calling for help as a quiet night becomes a desperate struggle to survive.\nBuild your killer\u2019s identity. Customize your appearance with masks, clothing, and accessories, then choose your signature weapon. Earn points through hunting, complete challenges, and unlock equipment and upgrades. Return to the workshop between nights to change your look and prepare for the next hunt.\n- Hands-on VR combat: Grab, strike, throw, and interact with weapons and your surroundings.\n- Reactive survivors: Hunt campers who hide, resist, cooperate, and attempt to escape.\n- Your own approach: Stalk from the shadows, sabotage escape plans, or confront your targets directly.\n- Killer customization: Build a recognizable look with unlockable masks, outfits, accessories, and weapons.\n- Progression with purpose: Earn points, improve your abilities, and expand your collection.\nThe woods are dark. Your next hunt is waiting...", "short_description": "Become the nightmare in Serial Killer Simulator, a VR slasher horror game. Create your killer, choose your mask and weapon, and stalk campers through dark forests and isolated cabins. Strike from the shadows, unleash brutal physics-based combat, and stop survivors before they escape. Earn points to unlock weapons, outfits, and accessories, then return to the workshop to perfect your killer. Every hunt builds your legend."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/d/1rSBro9MMNHkdy5m5ssUuSuPj9qk8kV5x/p/12l1RYJfFtSDyHYlUEdcc1JTvwX27RkLq/edit", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ThrowdownGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/throwdowngame/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topi